& [Observed] first integrated source audit assumed every manifest used direct source_file source_bytes and source_sha256 fields
  + five older manifests were falsely reported as mismatches
  + second attempt recognized one older PreservedSource block but incorrectly treated four SourcePath Bytes SHA256 manifests as the same profile
  + empty-path parameter errors followed because profile detection was incomplete and strict error handling was absent
& [Impact] read-only checks produced false diagnostics but wrote deleted compiled or executed nothing
  + no false mismatch enters completion proof
& [Correction] verifier recognizes three explicit profiles
  + direct_fields uses source_file source_bytes source_sha256
  + named_fields uses SourcePath Bytes SHA256
  + preserved_source_block uses path byte_length sha256
  + unknown profile is a hard fault under strict error handling
& [CorrectedResult] 12 source packages exact 12 mismatched 0 with profile counts 7 4 and 1
& [Prevention] manifest grammar version is data and cannot be inferred from directory chronology
